exports[`MDRS docs examples render unchanged markdown-demo fixture 1`] = `
"<div class="mdrs-alert mdrs-alert--note">
  <div class="mdrs-alert-title">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mdrs-icon mdrs-icon-info"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4"/><path d="M12 8h.01"/></svg>
    <span>Note</span>
  </div>
  <div class="mdrs-alert-content"><p><strong>Welcome to my-site.example, where markdown comes alive.</strong> This is not your average markdown renderer. What you are reading right now is a living document: every heading, chart, formula, and data point on this page is processed by our custom-built <strong>Next-Gen Markdown Engine</strong>, compiled at the edge, and delivered in under 100ms. Below is everything it can do.</p>
</div>
</div><hr>
<h2>Typography That Speaks</h2>
<p>Formatting is the foundation. We support every inline style you would expect, and a few you would not.</p>
<ul class="mdrs-list mdrs-list--unordered">
<li class="mdrs-list-item"><span class="mdrs-list-marker" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="mdrs-list-content"><strong>Bold</strong> with <code>**asterisks**</code> or <code>__underscores__</code></div></li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item"><span class="mdrs-list-marker" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="mdrs-list-content"><em>Italic</em> with <code>_underscores_</code> or <code>*asterisks*</code></div></li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item"><span class="mdrs-list-marker" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="mdrs-list-content"><em><strong>Bold italic</strong></em> for when you really mean it</div></li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item"><span class="mdrs-list-marker" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="mdrs-list-content"><del>Strikethrough</del> for deprecated ideas</div></li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item"><span class="mdrs-list-marker" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="mdrs-list-content"><u>Underline</u> for emphasis that stands apart</div></li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item"><span class="mdrs-list-marker" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="mdrs-list-content"><code>Inline code</code> like <code>const x: number = 42</code> rendered in monospace</div></li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item"><span class="mdrs-list-marker" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="mdrs-list-content"><mark>Highlighted text</mark> for search-match style callouts</div></li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item"><span class="mdrs-list-marker" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="mdrs-list-content">Chemical formulas: H<sub>2</sub>O, and exponents: 10<sup>6</sup></div></li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item"><span class="mdrs-list-marker" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="mdrs-list-content">Keyboard shortcuts: <kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd>P</kbd> opens the Command Palette</div></li>
</ul>
<p>Every heading level renders with its own typographic scale:</p>
<h1>Heading 1</h1>
<h2>Heading 2</h2>
<h3>Heading 3</h3>
<h4>Heading 4</h4>
<h5>Heading 5</h5>
<h6>Heading 6</h6>
<hr>
<h2>Links, Quotes and Breaks</h2>
<p>Links follow the standard <code>[text](url &quot;title&quot;)</code> form. The optional title becomes a tooltip: <a href="https://google.com" title="Google" class="mdrs-external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mdrs-icon mdrs-icon-external-link"><path d="M15 3h6v6"/><path d="M10 14 21 3"/><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/></svg></a>.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>A greater than sign opens a blockquote.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>A backslash at the end of a line<br>forces a line break.</p>
<p>Three asterisks or three dashes draw a thematic break:</p>
<hr>
<hr>
<h2>Lists &amp; Task Tracking</h2>
<h3>Ordered Lists</h3>
<ol class="mdrs-list mdrs-list--ordered">
<li class="mdrs-list-item">Provision your edge runtime and database</li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item">Configure server-side rendering:<ol class="mdrs-list mdrs-list--ordered">
<li class="mdrs-list-item">Set up KaTeX compilation</li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item">Wire Mermaid lazy hydration</li>
</ol></li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item">Ship it</li>
</ol>
<h3>Unordered Lists</h3>
<ul class="mdrs-list mdrs-list--unordered">
<li class="mdrs-list-item"><span class="mdrs-list-marker" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="mdrs-list-content"><strong>Frontend</strong>: SvelteKit 5 with Svelte Runes, Tailwind CSS 4, Cloudflare Pages</div></li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item"><span class="mdrs-list-marker" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="mdrs-list-content"><strong>Backend</strong>: Cloudflare D1 with a generational read cache, Cloudflare R2 Storage</div></li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item"><span class="mdrs-list-marker" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="mdrs-list-content"><strong>Engine</strong>: Custom directive parser, KaTeX SSR, LayerChart, Mermaid.js</div></li>
</ul>
<h3>Task Lists with Seven Status States</h3>
<p>Every checkbox state gets its own icon and color, not just checked and unchecked:</p>
<ul class="mdrs-list mdrs-list--unordered">
<li class="mdrs-list-item mdrs-task mdrs-task--done"><span class="mdrs-task-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mdrs-icon"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><span class="mdrs-sr-only">Done: </span><div class="mdrs-task-content">Ship KaTeX server-side math rendering</div></li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item mdrs-task mdrs-task--in-progress"><span class="mdrs-task-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mdrs-icon"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><path d="M12 8v8"/><path d="m8.5 14 7-4"/><path d="m8.5 10 7 4"/></svg></span><span class="mdrs-sr-only">In progress: </span><div class="mdrs-task-content">Interactive chart tooltips with accessibility labels (WIP)</div></li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item mdrs-task mdrs-task--failed"><span class="mdrs-task-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mdrs-icon"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><path d="m15 9-6 6"/><path d="m9 9 6 6"/></svg></span><span class="mdrs-sr-only">Failed: </span><div class="mdrs-task-content">Legacy graph parser removal (Cancelled)</div></li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item mdrs-task mdrs-task--skipped"><span class="mdrs-task-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mdrs-icon"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="12" y2="12"/></svg></span><span class="mdrs-sr-only">Skipped: </span><div class="mdrs-task-content">Plugin migration to v3 hooks (On-Hold)</div></li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item mdrs-task mdrs-task--important"><span class="mdrs-task-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mdrs-icon"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="8" y2="12"/><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="16" y2="16"/></svg></span><span class="mdrs-sr-only">Important: </span><div class="mdrs-task-content">Critical: patch CVE-2026-XXXX in dependency tree (Alert)</div></li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item mdrs-task mdrs-task--question"><span class="mdrs-task-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mdrs-icon"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><rect width="8" height="8" x="8" y="8" rx="1"/></svg></span><span class="mdrs-sr-only">Question: </span><div class="mdrs-task-content">Should code tabs persist selection via <code>localStorage</code>? (Review)</div></li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item mdrs-task mdrs-task--todo"><span class="mdrs-task-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mdrs-icon"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/></svg></span><span class="mdrs-sr-only">To do: </span><div class="mdrs-task-content">Footnote back-reference animations (Planned)<ul class="mdrs-list mdrs-list--unordered">
<li class="mdrs-list-item mdrs-task mdrs-task--done"><span class="mdrs-task-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mdrs-icon"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><span class="mdrs-sr-only">Done: </span><div class="mdrs-task-content">Sub-task: multi-backref letter indexing</div></li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item mdrs-task mdrs-task--in-progress"><span class="mdrs-task-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mdrs-icon"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><path d="M12 8v8"/><path d="m8.5 14 7-4"/><path d="m8.5 10 7 4"/></svg></span><span class="mdrs-sr-only">In progress: </span><div class="mdrs-task-content">Sub-task: smooth scroll behavior</div></li>
