</ul></div></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2>Callouts</h2>
<h3>Alerts</h3>
<p>Five built-in severity levels, each written as <code>:::type</code> and closed with <code>:::</code>. The content is regular Markdown:</p>
<pre data-mdrs-filename="alerts.md"><code class="language-markdown">:::note
