</div><hr>
<h2>Step-by-Step Timelines</h2>
<p>The <code>:::steps</code> directive transforms lists and headings into a numbered timeline with connecting lines.</p>
<h3>Heading-Based</h3>
<div class="mdrs-steps">
<div class="mdrs-step"><h3>Install Dependencies</h3>
<pre><code class="language-bash">bun add katex mermaid layerchart d3-scale d3-shape
</code></pre></div>
<div class="mdrs-step"><h3>Configure Server-Side Compilation</h3>
<p>Wire KaTeX and the directive preprocessor into <code>src/lib/markdown.ts</code>. Math formulas compile to HTML+MathML at build time, zero client JS.</p></div>
<div class="mdrs-step"><h3>Hydrate Client Enhancements</h3>
<p>Attach <code>enhanceMarkdownContent()</code> in your page effect to lazily activate Mermaid, LayerChart, and Code Tabs on scroll.</p></div>
<div class="mdrs-step"><h3>Verify and Ship</h3>
<pre><code class="language-bash">bun run check &amp;&amp; bun run lint
</code></pre></div>
</div><h3>Ordered List-Based</h3>
<div class="mdrs-steps">
<ol class="mdrs-steps-list">
<li class="mdrs-step">Clone the repository and create your <code>.env</code> from the example template.</li>
<li class="mdrs-step">Run <code>bun install</code> to install all workspace dependencies.</li>
<li class="mdrs-step">Start the dev server with <code>bun run dev</code>, hot module replacement included.</li>
<li class="mdrs-step">Verify with <code>bun run check</code> and <code>bun run lint</code> before pushing.</li>
</ol>
</div><h3>Unordered List-Based</h3>
<div class="mdrs-steps">
<ol class="mdrs-steps-list">
<li class="mdrs-step"><div class="mdrs-list-content">Provision edge functions and R2 storage buckets.</div></li>
<li class="mdrs-step"><div class="mdrs-list-content">Run the integration smoke test suite.</div></li>
<li class="mdrs-step"><div class="mdrs-list-content">Promote the preview deployment to production.</div></li>
</ol>
</div><hr>
<h2>Dynamic Variables</h2>
<p>Every value on this page is alive. The <code>:::define</code> block at the top of this document declares typed variables (strings, numbers, booleans, arrays, and objects) with full expression support: arithmetic (<code>+ - * / %</code>), comparison (<code>== != &gt; &lt; &gt;= &lt;=</code>), logical (<code>&amp;&amp; || !</code>), and cross-references via <code>this.*</code>.</p>
<h3>What was declared</h3>
<pre><code class="language-text">:::define
site_name: &quot;my-site.example&quot;
engine_version: &quot;2.1&quot;
current_year: 2026
is_production: true
visitor_greeting: &quot;Welcome to &quot; + this.site_name + &quot;, where markdown comes alive&quot;
math_demo: (2 + 3) * 4
supported_locales: [&quot;en&quot;, &quot;id&quot;]
engine_stats: { directives: 14, chart_types: 5, since: 2026, stable: true }
:::
</code></pre>
<h3>What you see (live interpolation)</h3>
<ul class="mdrs-list mdrs-list--unordered">
<li class="mdrs-list-item"><span class="mdrs-list-marker" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="mdrs-list-content">Greeting: <strong>Welcome to my-site.example, where markdown comes alive</strong></div></li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item"><span class="mdrs-list-marker" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="mdrs-list-content">Site: <strong>my-site.example</strong>, engine v2.1, copyright 2026</div></li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item"><span class="mdrs-list-marker" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="mdrs-list-content">Expression <code>(2 + 3) * 4</code> evaluates to: <strong>20</strong></div></li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item"><span class="mdrs-list-marker" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="mdrs-list-content">First locale: <strong>en</strong> out of 2 supported</div></li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item"><span class="mdrs-list-marker" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="mdrs-list-content">Directive count from nested object: <strong>14</strong></div></li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item"><span class="mdrs-list-marker" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="mdrs-list-content">You are viewing the production build of this page.</div></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2>Live Data Binding</h2>
<p>The <code>api.v1.*</code> prefix fetches real data from this site&#39;s own API at render time, with no manual <code>curl</code> and no hardcoded values. The engine resolves paths like <code>api.v1.author.profile.name</code> against the live database during server-side rendering.</p>
<ul class="mdrs-list mdrs-list--unordered">
<li class="mdrs-list-item"><span class="mdrs-list-marker" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="mdrs-list-content">Author: <strong><span class="mdrs-define-error" title="Database access is unavailable in this context.">[define error]</span></strong></div></li>
<li class="mdrs-list-item"><span class="mdrs-list-marker" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="mdrs-list-content">Published posts: <strong><span class="mdrs-define-error" title="Database access is unavailable in this context.">[define error]</span></strong></div></li>
</ul>
<p>This is the same data you would get from <code>GET /api/v1/author?fields=profile</code> and <code>GET /api/v1/blog</code>, but inlined directly into the markdown body at compile time. No client-side fetch, no loading spinner, no layout shift.</p>
<hr>
<h2>Images and Videos</h2>
<p>Images and videos share one syntax: <code>![alt](source &quot;title&quot;)</code>. The source extension decides the element: <code>.mp4</code> and <code>.webm</code> render a <code>&lt;video&gt;</code> with controls, anything else renders an <code>&lt;img&gt;</code>. The alt text is the accessible label and the optional title is the tooltip.</p>
<pre data-mdrs-filename="media.md"><code class="language-markdown">![Architecture overview](/blog/content/&lt;hash&gt;.webp &quot;Architecture overview&quot;)

![Product demo](/blog/content/&lt;hash&gt;.mp4 &quot;Product demo&quot;)
</code></pre>
<p>Upload media from the editor toolbar: it inserts the correct syntax for you.</p>
<hr>
<h2>Media Embeds</h2>
<p>A single <code>:::embed url=&quot;...&quot;</code> line handles provider detection, responsive aspect-ratio wrapping, and iframe security. No manual HTML needed, and no closing line:</p>
<div class="mdrs-embed"><iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ec08db2hP10" loading="lazy" allowfullscreen title="Embedded content"></iframe></div><div class="mdrs-embed"><iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/VyPwEZTIpVc" loading="lazy" allowfullscreen title="Embedded content"></iframe></div><p>Unrecognized providers fall back to a styled external link instead of a broken iframe:</p>
<p><a href="https://example.com/some-video" class="mdrs-external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://example.com/some-video<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mdrs-icon mdrs-icon-external-link"><path d="M15 3h6v6"/><path d="M10 14 21 3"/><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/></svg></a></p>
<hr>
